<title>CANADA: Revenue Properties unit in U.S. merger.</title>
<headline>Revenue Properties unit in U.S. merger.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revenue Properties Co Ltd said on Wednesday its subsidiary, Pan Pacific Development (U.S.) Inc, entered into a definitive merger agreement with Pacific Real Estate Investment Trust (PREIT) and Pacific Real Estate Investment Trust Inc (PAC REIT).</p>
<p>Revenue Properties said Pan Pacific Development will cause the merger of its subsidiaries with PAC REIT subsidiaries, and PREIT will contribute its assets to a PAC REIT subsidiary.</p>
<p>Closing is expected during the second quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
